message: "If you use this software in your research or application, please cite it using the following metadata."
title: "Vietnamese AI: A Lightweight, Zero-Dependency, and Verifiable Framework for Vietnamese-Centric AI and Distributed Swarm CPU Inference"
abstract: "Vietnamese AI is a production-grade, zero-dependency artificial intelligence framework tailored for the Vietnamese language and resource-constrained computing environments. It provides native high-speed tokenization, hierarchy-preserving administrative Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG), distributed swarm CPU inference with pipeline parallelism, and verifiable inference commitments via Schnorr non-interactive zero-knowledge proofs and Merkle trees."
